    <briefdescription>
<para>This traversal uses the Memory Pool traversal to fixup the friend specifications on template declarations. </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>There appears to be no way to tell if a template declaration for a function is marked as friend except that the scopes are different. So we use this information to explicitly mark friends. </para>    </detaileddescription>
